'' 'test "x"' after a 'sub test' is still a call: the block is recognised only when no procedure
'' called test is declared above it (parser/testblock.tiko).
'' TEST: cli
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' CLEAN: build/.tbk
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/parser/src/test-block-not-keyword.tiko -o build/.tbk/a.exe
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: build/.tbk/a.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: called hi
